// The base everyone is built on (pipeline/pixel/README.md, "Characters"): a 25 x 35 frame, the feet on the bottom row,
// the head 15 pixels wide. Facing down, up and left (right is left mirrored by the game), each standing and in two
// steps. Skin is drawn in the skin slot (a b c), so any skin tone is a swap; shoes are the fixed brown (o, O).
// Each eye is 2 x 3: an ink lash, an iris (g, the eyes slot) and a white glint (w). One pixel of ink on the outside
// of the silhouette only; light from the upper left (a lit, b shade, c darkest).
// Outfits, hair and hats are drawn over this in the same frame.

sprite body/base 25 35

frame down
